# The plugin's bundled CLI: generated by `npm run build:plugin` and published to the `plugin`
# branch by CI on a release tag. Built code does not belong in main — see
# .github/workflows/publish-plugin.yml.
bin/

# skills/ is generated by the same command and IS committed, because
# `npx skills add JSiapoDEV/vibeward` reads the default branch. CI fails when the committed
# copies differ from what the templates generate.

# Notas de trabajo, solo locales. No forman parte del proyecto publicado.
